flowchart TB
  A[Validated new Report] --> B[Filter open Issues by same category]
  B --> C[Compute distance to issue location]
  C --> D{Within configured radius?
PROPOSED default: 50 m}
  D -- No --> E[Create new Issue]
  D -- Yes --> F[Candidate issues]
  F --> G{Candidate count}
  G -- 0 --> E
  G -- 1 --> H[Attach to only/nearest candidate]
  G -- >1 --> I[Choose nearest or flag for Reviewer confirmation]
  E --> J[Transactional write]
  H --> J
  I --> J
